{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a943mdk7","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":97,"top":1054,"width":1785,"height":58},"text":"2   Play & interaction / a workshop loop","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xcvmhs3i","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":1116,"width":1760,"height":49},"text":"BUILD   /   TEST   /   DIAGNOSE   /   REVISE   /   FIGHT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":35,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wbmlon2x","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":1192,"width":1760,"height":159},"text":"Assemble a modular spacecraft on a 3D grid. Configure directional propulsion, then try movement and weapons in the range. Compare behavior with the design you intended. Return to the blueprint before facing arcade combat waves.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6tkbylg","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":1355,"width":830,"height":40},"text":"Freedom to experiment","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5k3itkv","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":1401,"width":830,"height":150},"text":"All parts are available from the start. Save unfinished or over-budget ideas. Deployment requires a connected ship within the mission budget.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98v2d83m","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":1355,"width":830,"height":40},"text":"Choices have consequences","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o72lk321","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":1401,"width":830,"height":150},"text":"Blocked exhaust reduces usable thrust. Armor adds mass. Insufficient power reduces output. Each limit gives the player a reason to redesign.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/47y18zih","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":1984,"width":850,"height":40},"text":"Reassembly [1]","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p87ih4j2","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":2027,"width":850,"height":110},"text":"Borrow: a readable parts palette and the link between ship design and performance.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#657177","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lgz6p0r","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":1984,"width":850,"height":40},"text":"Robocraft [2]","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3mp0fu1c","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":2027,"width":850,"height":110},"text":"Borrow: the build bay and the satisfaction of taking your own machine into combat.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#657177","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/cbi1czit","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":99,"top":2114,"width":1751,"height":2},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#C5C5C1","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dcril4je","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":2139,"width":290,"height":65},"text":"UI / UX","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q90ja90n","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":400,"top":2139,"width":1430,"height":90},"text":"The editor feels like a workbench. Speed, energy and component diagnostics explain failures and guide the next revision.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ra90ju18","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":2280,"width":1840,"height":350},"geometry":"rect","lineColor":"#C5C5C1","lineWidth":1.3}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sfeh0f2p","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":97,"top":2304,"width":1785,"height":58},"text":"3   Spaces / a workshop in orbit","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tgni9kju","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":2366,"width":840,"height":40},"text":"Structures & wear","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/loji54nq","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":2412,"width":840,"height":150},"text":"Component racks, modular frames and orbital platforms make space feel constructed. Scuffed metal suggests repeated use and repair.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kna1wz65","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":2366,"width":830,"height":40},"text":"Ritual places","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zm103u5k","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":2412,"width":830,"height":150},"text":"The test range is a place to repeat first launch, measurement and return. Cold planetary light contrasts with warm work lights in the bay.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ylsjupoz","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":2660,"width":1840,"height":220},"geometry":"rect","lineColor":"#C5C5C1","lineWidth":1.3}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xkji14ne","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":97,"top":2684,"width":1785,"height":58},"text":"4   Sound / feedback for experiments","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cja1sz6t","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":2750,"width":1730,"height":106},"text":"An equipment hum supports concentration. Placement clicks confirm decisions. Changing engine response makes tests readable. A power warning prompts diagnosis; a clean launch after revision marks progress.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/bih0zu58","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":2910,"width":1840,"height":290},"geometry":"rect","lineColor":"#C5C5C1","lineWidth":1.3}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ah8jqpo3","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":97,"top":2934,"width":1785,"height":58},"text":"5   Look / visible construction","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pgzixkni","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":3000,"width":830,"height":40},"text":"Shape & material","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ofq1of6x","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":3046,"width":830,"height":130},"text":"Modular blocks, exposed joints and clear silhouettes reveal how things fit. Worn panels and work lights suggest practical use.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ep47i10j","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":3000,"width":830,"height":40},"text":"Color & light","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fadobmh4","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1000,"top":3046,"width":830,"height":130},"text":"Graphite and off-white keep parts readable. Cyan identifies tools, amber signals attention and red marks a fault.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/gbmpkrip","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":3230,"width":1840,"height":260},"geometry":"rect","lineColor":"#C5C5C1","lineWidth":1.3}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1cvqdwzu","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":97,"top":3254,"width":1785,"height":58},"text":"6   Sources / DIY Maker Culture","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lk7eh07","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":3320,"width":1720,"height":106},"text":"DIY Maker Culture comes from hands-on workshops and makerspaces, represented by Maker Faire and student machine shops, with Robocraft, Reassembly and Minecraft as game references for player-built creations.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rmto7mhs","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":100,"top":3431,"width":1730,"height":37},"text":"Culture: Maker Faire, Mission [7]. Workshop rule: CMU, Makerspace Safety Program [8].","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#657177","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/snmpgrid","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":1980,"top":635,"width":940,"height":62},"text":"DIY CONSTRUCTION / GAME REFERENCES","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":34,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CB4A4F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
