{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ra107adw","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":2010,"top":3243,"width":890,"height":204},"text":"Never adjust machinery while it is running. Manual structural editing is unavailable during combat. The player must finish or exit the run and return to construction. Until then, the design must face its weaknesses. Automatic recovery remains a separate system.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#20262A","alignment":"left"}}
